          "operation_detail": "Single DAPI-positive nuclei are FACS-sorted into wells pre-loaded with 2X lysis buffer (Tris-HCl, NaCl, proteinase K, SDS) and 10 uM S5xx/N7xx Nextera index primer mix; Tn5 is released at 65 C for 15 min, SDS is quenched with 10% TWEEN-20, PCR master mix is added, and the 72 C hold at the start of the amplification programme fills the 9-nt gaps and extends each 3' end to copy the opposite adapter, producing a blunt duplex.",
