          "operation_detail": "Indexing PCR in the same 20 ul well reaction with the Nextera N/S5xx and N7xx index primers (98 C 5 min, then 18 cycles of 98 C 10 s / 63 C 30 s / 72 C 20 s; the cycle number is chosen by qPCR). Each well receives a unique i5 + i7 combination, so the indices act as single-cell barcodes. All wells are then pooled and the pool is purified on a Qiagen MinElute column and double-sided SPRI size-selected (0.5X upper, 1.2X lower cutoff) before quantification and dilution; these non-architectural steps are folded into this transition.",
